ey":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemmas 7.3.7 and 7.3.13 (derived weaker bound)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"113,115–116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"123,125–126"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-derived-corollary-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a>，序数指数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{\\omega^\\alpha}(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{\\omega^\\alpha}(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5473eae254230968\" href=\"?note=5473eae254230968\" title=\"18-thm-basic-elimination\">18-thm-basic-elimination</a> 的原书 2^α 界和 Structural Lemma 7.3.7 得到：2<sup>α≤ω</sup>α，可提高高度上界。文件名是保留的本地ID；原书 Definition 5.3.1 是真算术句分类观察，并非切消定理。修复旧稿“任意无穷演算 P”适用范围过宽的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-thm-basic-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"5473eae254230968","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-basic-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-basic-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"5473eae254230968","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由 [[18-thm-basic-elimination]] 的原书 2^α 界和 Structural Lemma 7.3.7 得到：2^α≤ω^α，可提高高度上界。文件名是保留的本地ID；原书 Definition 5.3.1 是真算术句分类观察，并非切消定理。修复旧稿“任意无穷演算 P”适用范围过宽的问题。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{\\omega^\\alpha}(\\Delta).","display":true}],"bytes":1473,"backlinks":[{"id":"75fad619adeaa882","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"定义的是降秩后的输入输出关系；没有宣称它是一条局部重写步骤、可计算变换或对任意演算总定义的函数。旧稿未要求两棵树为同一演算的合法证明。实际存在性须有具体切消定理，见 [[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]"},{"id":"4104af313be51221","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","元数据 · canonical_document","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"本文件是 [[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]] 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。"},{"id":"62c13ef1c5cb9a73","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对 n 归纳。n=0 时为恒等。n+1 时先用 [[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]] 得到 D_n^{ω^α}，再用归纳假设；有限迭代满足 ω_n(ω^α)=ω_{n+1}(α)。n=0 已包含在断言中。结论只涉及已定义的 NT 半形式系统。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]"}],"outgoing":["5473eae254230968","8accc2f8cbc49eab","5c52eb8a9d5ba532"]}